# Vertical of a Cell (reference/components/table.md#vertical-alignment-of-the-content-vertical). Page area of
# 260 × 160 from (20, 20). Every cell has Border: 0.5 and stays stretched to its row: what moves is its content.
#
# t1: five columns of 52 and one row, 60 high (the block of a1, 59 plus the border). The cells with a value (v2
#   center, v3 end) move their line; the cells with elements (e4 center, e5 end from the rule For style: bottom) move
#   their block, 20 high.
# t2: s1 takes up the two rows (20 and 30, plus the border) and centers its line in the height of both.
# t3: its row does not fit in what is left of page 1 and is split. p1 measures 100 (60 + 40) and k1, with
#   Vertical: bottom, 80 (60 + 20): on page 1 their content reaches the end of the page and does not move; on page 2 the
#   row measures what is left of p1, and what is left of k1, 20 shorter, goes to its bottom.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: Table
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 10 0
		For element: Cell
			Box:
				Border: 0.5
				Border color: #333333
		For style: bottom
			Vertical: bottom
		For style: tall
			Box:
				Height: 59
				Background: #F1EFE8
		For style: mark
			Box:
				Height: 20
				Background: #B5D4F4
	Section:
		Table:
			Id: t1
			Column sizes: 52 52 52 52 52
			Body rows:
				Row:
					Cell:
						Id: a1
						Block:
							Style: tall
					Cell: Centro
						Id: v2
						Vertical: center
					Cell: Abajo
						Id: v3
						Vertical: bottom
					Cell:
						Id: e4
						Vertical: center
						Block:
							Id: m4
							Style: mark
					Cell:
						Id: e5
						Style: bottom
						Block:
							Id: m5
							Style: mark
		Table:
			Id: t2
			Column sizes: 130 130
			Body rows:
				Row:
					Cell: Dos filas
						Id: s1
						Span: 2 1
						Vertical: center
					Cell:
						Id: r1
						Box:
							Height: 20
				Row:
					Cell:
						Id: r2
						Box:
							Height: 30
		Table:
			Id: t3
			Column sizes: 130 130
			Body rows:
				Row:
					Cell:
						Id: p1
						Block:
							Id: p1a
							Box:
								Height: 60
								Background: #E1F0E8
						Block:
							Id: p1b
							Box:
								Height: 40
								Background: #F0E8E1
					Cell:
						Id: k1
						Vertical: bottom
						Block:
							Id: k1a
							Box:
								Height: 60
								Background: #E1E8F0
						Block:
							Id: k1b
							Style: mark
